00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,976
In the throat the water moves faster, so by Bernoulli, its pressure must be lower.

2
00:00:05,976 --> 00:00:09,427
The water column above the throat is shorter.

3
00:00:09,427 --> 00:00:11,783
Faster flow, lower pressure.

4
00:00:11,783 --> 00:00:13,763
That is the heart of Bernoulli.

